# Steps

::::steps[Set up a project]

## Install

Add the packages:

```sh
pnpm add -D mdsvex @mdsvex/plugin-steps
```

## Configure

Call the plugin in `vite.config.js`.

### A deeper heading

It stays in the body of its step.

